"written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94764828", "author": {"steamid": "76561198159596200", "personaname": "Hurdan0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hurdan0games/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 90, "playtime_forever": 4278, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 589, "last_played": 1754207818, "avatar": "bd162d28bca4a827f0ef7dc55954cea2068f1eac"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "La única toxicidad que encontrarás en este juego es la de la cerveza. Bueno y radiación. Y veneno. Pero con cerveza se te pasan las últimas.\n\nPara tomarte una buena cerveza deberás:\n1º Tener casi cualquier cerveza menos Cruzcampo.\n2º Bien fresquita en la nevera. Si la acabas de comprar, déjala de 10 a 20 min en el congelador.\n3º Verter el contenido en un jarra favorita.\n4º Disfrutarla como un enano.\n\nPor último, me invitas a una, y me agregas para jugar juntos.\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1625089151, "timestamp_updated": 1625089151, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94753408", "author": {"steamid": "76561198167746332", "personaname": "Gappyside", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Gappyside/", "num_games_owned": 180, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 421, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 51, "last_played": 1627531532, "avatar": "7d1870addcd58ef5e66f2fc98d17325374575543"}, "language": "spanish", "review": "ta weno el juego waaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaajajajaa", "timestamp_created": 1625077808, "timestamp_updated": 1625077808, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_